    "text": "In the following system, $\\mathrm{PCl}_5(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{PCl}_3(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ at equilibrium, upon addition of xenon gas at constant $\\mathrm{T} \\& \\mathrm{p}$, the concentration of",
